{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>They shall be left.</b> This is the camp of Assyria annihilated by the angel." "<b>לעיט.</b> Like וירד העיט (Genesis 15:11), on the pattern of שש (Esther 1:6) and שיש (II Chronicles 29:2)." "<b>And summer.</b> From the root of קיץ (Genesis 8:22)." "<b>Shall winter.</b> From the root of חורף [ibid.], to eat the carcasses of the dead."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:12.339617537Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}